    L "I can read it to Yagami-kun."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:168
translate english book1_f2b0ff43:
    # L "我念给夜神君听吧。"
    L "Let me read it to Yagami-kun."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:172
translate english book1_be3ba497:
    # "月露出了“果然如此”的眼神。不过他也没有多说什么，毕竟在L的私人监狱里，他没办法抗拒L的意志。"
    "Light gave a look that said 'I knew it'. However, he didn't say anything more—after all, in L's private prison, he couldn't resist L's will."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:174
translate english book1_ddedc70f:
    # "L坐到床边，和月保持了一定距离，他的嗓音低沉，语调平平不带感情，就像在念一份报告。"
    "L sat by the bed, keeping a certain distance from Light. His voice was deep, and his tone was flat and emotionless, as if he were reading a report."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:188
translate english book3_3c189ca7:
    # Y smile1 "谢谢。"
    Y smile1 "Thank you."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:190
translate english book3_630b5700:
    # "月活动了一下手腕，接过L手上的书籍，准备打开书本翻阅。"
    "Light moved his wrist slightly, took the book from L's hand, and prepared to open it to read."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:190
translate english book3_466e7991:
    # "下一秒他有些诧异地看着L没有选择离开，而是同样坐了下来，望向他手中的书本。"
    "The next second, he looked at L in surprise—L didn't choose to leave; instead, he sat down too and looked at the book in Light's hand."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:195
translate english book3_5d23186c:
    # L smile2 "我想和夜神君一起看。"
    L smile2 "I want to read with Yagami-kun."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:197
translate english book3_c349cbf5:
    # Y Light "……算了，随你便吧"
    Y Light "……Fine, do as you like."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:199
translate english book3_d6224742:
    # "月举着书，把朝向往L的方向偏了一些，让对方也能看见书上的文字。"
    "Light held up the book and tilted it slightly toward L, so that the other person could also see the text on the book."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:199
translate english book3_aebf6775:
    # "L从善如流地凑过来，蹲坐在月的旁边。"
    "L readily leaned over and squatted beside Light."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:199
translate english book3_36df2117:
    # "月皱了皱眉，这么近的距离，他确实有点不太自在。"
    "Light frowned—at such a close distance, he really felt a bit uncomfortable."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:199
translate english book3_b4872c20:
    # "这个距离近到已经突破了社交距离的30cm，近到他甚至能闻到L身上清爽的沐浴露味道。"
    "This distance was so close that it exceeded the 30cm social distance—so close that he could even smell the fresh body wash scent on L."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:199
translate english book3_95b8bfb5:
    # "月强迫自己清空杂念，把注意力放到书上。"
    " Light forced himself to clear his mind and focus on the book."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:221
translate english book2_765928af:
    # L "不用这么麻烦，这样夜神君也可以看见。"
    L "No need for all this trouble—this way, Yagami-kun can also see it."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:223
translate english book2_da5af262:
    # L "夜神君只要坐着就好。"
    L "Yagami-kun just needs to sit."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:225
translate english book2_1f78f859:
    # "L坐到了月的旁边，难得没有采用蹲姿，而是把书摊开到两人的大腿上。"
    "L sat beside Light. Rarely, he didn't squat; instead, he spread the book open on both of their laps."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:225
translate english book2_36df2117:
    # "月皱了皱眉，这么近的距离，他确实有点不太自在。"
    "Light frowned—at such a close distance, he really felt a bit uncomfortable."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:225
