    # "这个距离近到已经突破了社交距离的30cm，近到他甚至能闻到L身上清爽的沐浴露味道。"
    "This distance was so close that it exceeded the 30cm social distance—so close he could even smell the fresh scent of body wash on L. "
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:225
translate english book2_95b8bfb5:
    # "月强迫自己清空杂念，把注意力放到书上。"
    "Light forced himself to clear his distractions and focus his attention on the book."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:258
translate english reaction_sleep_6a6ed6c6:
    # "月听着听着，竟然产生了困意，不知不觉低着头睡着了。"
    "As Light listened, he unexpectedly felt sleepy and unknowingly bowed his head and fell asleep."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:259
translate english reaction_sleep_d3d5d8e7:
    # "L察觉到之后停止了读书，有些无奈地让月侧躺在床上，给他盖上了被子，然后悄然离开了囚室。"
    "After noticing, L stopped reading. With a hint of helplessness, he helped Light lie on his side on the bed, covered him with a quilt, and then quietly left the cell."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:276
translate english reaction_chat_e532d013:
    # "月逐渐沉浸在了书中的世界里，看向把自己关起来的罪魁祸首也没那么不顺眼了，甚至偶尔还会跟L聊上几句书里的内容。"
    "Light gradually immersed himself in the world of the book. The person who locked him up no longer seemed so unpleasant to look at—he even occasionally chatted with L about the book's content."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:276
translate english reaction_chat_54b87cb6:
    # "两人度过了一段轻松愉快的时间。"
    "The two of them spent a relaxed and pleasant time together."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:294
translate english reaction_debate_2380f789:
    # "月相当专注，在书的进度推进到他感兴趣的内容时，他甚至会主动叫住L来和自己讨论。"
    "Light was quite focused. When the book progressed to content he was interested in, he would even take the initiative to stop L and discuss it with him."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:294
translate english reaction_debate_5fbf6d57:
    # "他的见解相当锐利，直指矛盾核心，有时候可以说是激进，L也跟他有来有往地辩论起来，最后谁也没说服谁。"
    "His insights were quite sharp, directly pointing to the core of the contradiction—sometimes even radical. L debated back and forth with him, and in the end, neither convinced the other."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:294
translate english reaction_debate_ac7977a6:
    # "不过月最后也没有显得生气，他难得直视L的眼睛，问他下次什么时候再把书带来。"
    "However, Light didn't seem angry in the end. Rarely, he looked directly into L's eyes and asked when L would bring the book again next time."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:317
translate english reaction_angry_95bcfc20:
    # "月难得有了表达欲，他开始针对书中的内容发表自己的长篇大论，并且越说越兴奋。"
    "Light rarely felt the urge to express himself. He began to expound at length on the book's content, and grew more excited as he spoke."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:317
translate english reaction_angry_b52c59c6:
    # "L对看书时频繁被打断的现状感到不满，于是他也开始了自己的报复行为："
    "L was dissatisfied with being frequently interrupted while reading, so he also started his own act of retaliation:"
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:317
translate english reaction_angry_5c0174bf:
    # "如果这是一本推理小说，他直接剧透了犯人是谁；"
    "If it was a mystery novel, he directly spoiled who the culprit was;"
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:317
translate english reaction_angry_2df8086c:
    # "如果这是一本哲学书，他专门翻到月讨厌的论点部分；"
    "If it was a philosophy book, he specifically flipped to the section with arguments Light hated;"
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:317
translate english reaction_angry_f3f9eb92:
    # "如果……没有如果了，月彻底愤怒了，他大声控诉了L这种不道德的行为，但是L只是面瘫着脸把书合上，然后站到了囚室外面，关上门。"
    "If... there were no more 'ifs'. Light was completely furious. He loudly accused L of this immoral act, but L just closed the book with a blank expression, then stood outside the cell and shut the door."
# game/script/daily_pastime.rpy:317
translate english reaction_angry_faa7f2a9:
    # "月瞪着L，差点把自己气出内伤。"
    "Light glared at L, almost making himself sick with anger."
